WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Memory-City - Upper Spire, desperate.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.300 align:center
Lyra: No! Not this one!

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Release. It serves no purpose.

4
00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.900 align:center
Lyra: You won't have him!

5
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:13.200 align:center
Kael: Let go... Lyra...

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Memory-City - Mid-Level Platforms, urgent.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.800 align:center
Lyra: Almost... there!

8
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.100 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Such struggle. For so little.

9
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.400 align:center
Lyra: Stay back!

10
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.700 align:center
Kael: Not yet... It's too soon...

11
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Crumbling Memory-City - Collapsed Bridge, dread.

12
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.300 align:center
Lyra: My arm! No!

13
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A forgotten joy. Such a simple release.

14
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:38.900 align:center
Lyra: Don't touch it!

15
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.200 align:center
Kael: This path... it fails...

16
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.500 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Memory-Storm Chasm - Volatile Emotions, tense.

17
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:47.800 align:center
Lyra: Sharp! Too close!

18
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.100 align:center
Lyra: Hold tight...

19
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.400 align:center
Kael: These feelings... not yours...

20
00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.700 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Memory-Storm Chasm - Narrow Ledge, dread.

21
00:00:56.1000 --> 00:00:59.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We protect. From the pain of remembering.

22
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:01.300 align:center
Lyra: Lies. You destroy.

23
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We offer peace. Let it go.

24
00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:04.900 align:center
Lyra: Never!

25
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:10.200 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Memory-Storm Chasm - Crumbling Ascent, desperate.

26
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.500 align:center
Lyra: Almost clear... Just a little more...

27
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.800 align:center
Kael: This weight... you carry too much...

28
00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.100 align:center
Lyra: I can't lose it!

29
00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:22.400 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Memory-Storm Chasm - Exposed Ledge, dread.

30
00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:23.700 align:center
Lyra: What was that?

31
00:01:23.1000 --> 00:01:24.1000 align:center
Lyra: My... my name...?

32
00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.300 align:center
Kael: It takes the edges... the newest...

33
00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:28.600 align:center
Lyra: It hurts!

34
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:33.900 align:center
♪ at dusk, in Memory-Storm Chasm - Lower Cavern Entrance, desperate.

35
00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:36.200 align:center
Lyra: Need to hide... regroup...

36
00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:37.500 align:center
Lyra: They're getting faster.

37
00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.800 align:center
Kael: You cannot outrun them... always...

38
00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:46.100 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Hidden Cavern - Dead End, dread.

39
00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.400 align:center
Lyra: No... a dead end!

40
00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:52.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The end of your resistance. The end of the pain.

41
00:01:52.1000 --> 00:01:54.1000 align:center
Lyra: I won't let you!

42
00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.300 align:center
Kael: This choice... it's yours...

43
00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:03.600 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Hidden Cavern - Sacrifice Point, desperate.

44
00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:04.900 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me, Kael.

45
00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:06.200 align:center
Kael: Live... Lyra... Remember...

46
00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:07.500 align:center
Lyra: GET BACK!

47
00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:08.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Impossible!

48
00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:14.100 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Memory-Void - Escape Route, dread.

49
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.400 align:center
Lyra: Free! I'm free!

50
00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:17.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: We knew you would spend it.

51
00:02:17.1000 --> 00:02:18.1000 align:center
Lyra: What... no...

52
00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your next step. Foreseen.
